# AB-026: Prepare the same buffer by two stoichiometrically equivalent routes
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 CH3COOH 0.002mol
add v1 NaOH 0.001mol
add v1 NaCl 0.001mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 NaOAc 0.002mol
add v2 HCl 0.001mol
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
measure v1 conductivity
measure v2 conductivity
inspect
